Privacy Policy for Spooky Sweet SwapLast Updated: October 12, 2026 This Privacy Policy describes how Spooky Sweet Swap ("we," "our," or "us") handles information when you install, play, or interact with our mobile game
We respect your privacy. Spooky Sweet Swap is designed as a casual match-3 game that does not require registration, accounts, or the collection of personal identifying details such as names, physical addresses, or phone numbers.  
1. Information We Do Not CollectPersonal Information: We do not collect, request, or store your real name, email address, physical address, contact lists, or phone numbers.   User Accounts: The game does not support or require user account creation or login via external platforms (such as Google Sign-In, Facebook, or Apple).   Sensitive Information: We do not collect financial records, payment card information, health data, or biometric data. 
