3. How We Use InformationAny technical or device data gathered by integrated third-party SDKs is used solely to:Ensure proper gameplay and stability across supported Android devices.Transmit notification alerts regarding gameplay energy, events, and features.Serve, monitor, and optimize in-game advertisements.Detect and prevent technical glitches, crashes, and unauthorized abuse.
4. Data Sharing and DisclosureWe do not sell, rent, or trade any personal user information. Technical data and device identifiers are shared strictly with:Third-party service providers (Google Firebase and Unity Technologies) under standard terms necessary to deliver notifications and advertising.Legal authorities only if required by applicable law, court order, or governmental regulation.
5. Data SecurityAll data transmitted by third-party services utilized in Spooky Sweet Swap is encrypted in transit using industry-standard protocols (HTTPS/TLS).
6. Children's PrivacySpooky Sweet Swap is intended for players aged 13 and older and is not targeted at children under 13. We do not knowingly solicit or collect personal information from children under the age of 13. If you believe a child under 13 has provided personal data through our third-party services, please contact us so we can take immediate steps to remove it.   
